IOTA Reader offers an incredible reading experience for Literacy LLC Books, Magazines and Newspapers on your iPad, iPhone and iPod. It also offers some foreign books but primarily is oriented on Georgian language reader.

This App is created to support education of people with visual impairment, with financial support of DVV International Georgia.

IOTA Reader has the following features:
• Free Georgian eBooks;
• Turn pages with the flick of a finger;
• Adjustable font size - make the text as big as you want for comfortable reading; 
• Multiple font types;
• Brightness control for easy reading in any light; 
• Night reading mode;
